--[[
    nova ui - Roblox UI library
    Pure library: executing this file alone shows nothing. It returns the
    Library table. Load it from your own script:

        local Library = loadstring(game:HttpGet("YOUR_RAW_PASTEBIN_URL"))()

    See the docs for the full API and a complete example script.

    Elements: Toggle (with keybind), Slider, Keybind picker, Dropdown,
    Multi-Dropdown, ColorPicker, Textbox, Button(s), Label, Title, Divider.
    Extras: tabs, unlimited sub-tabs, search bar, keybind list frame,
    rebindable hide-menu key, notifications, config save/load system.
]]

